bench-tps: report per-batch send latency and TPS statistics

Every sender thread records, for each batch it sends, the send time of the
batch in milliseconds and the batch's send rate in transactions per second.
After upstream's summary, bench-tps prints the elapsed time and summaries of
both sample sets ("latency stats", "tps stats": mean, stdev, min, p5..p99.999,
max).

Base: solana-labs/solana tag v1.18.26
      (commit d9f20e951a06b61e4505da0955228020b96a8915)
